---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About Us">
  <!-- Header Section -->
  <section class="bg-brand-700 text-white relative">
    <!-- Optional background image behind the text -->
    <img src="/images/slide1.jpg" alt="About Lubasa" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover opacity-20" />
    <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-16">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold mb-4">About LUBASA Investments</h1>
      <p class="text-brand-100 max-w-2xl text-lg">
        Learn more about our history, what we do, and where we are headed.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Main Content -->
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-16 space-y-6 text-slate-700 text-lg leading-relaxed">
    <p>
      <strong>LUBASA Investments and Company Limited</strong> is a comprehensive Ugandan manufacturing, supply, and service company registered in 2018. While our flagship work is the manufacturing of <strong>Extra Success Chalk</strong> (in white and assorted colours), we are also a major supplier of general stationery and office equipment. Our product range includes printers, pens, files, reams of paper, and other office essentials.
    </p>
    <p>
      Beyond supplying products, we provide professional services to our clients, including printing, graphic designing, and corporate branding. (As our company continues to grow, we are actively expanding into other business ventures and general supplies).
    </p>
    <p>
      Over the past 8 years, we have grown into a compliant, trusted, and export-ready business (Reg No: 80020001396985; URA TIN: 1015879930). We currently employ 18 permanent and 10 part-time workers, and our operations have created over 100 direct and indirect jobs in Uganda.
    </p>
    <p>
      What sets us apart is our commitment to our customers. We believe in providing highly quality products in plenty, listening to our customers' needs, and serving them at the appropriate time. With our flexible logistics, we ensure free transport from our factory to town and reliable delivery reaching everywhere in Kampala, the metropolitan area, and upcountry destinations within 1 to 2 days.
    </p>
    <p>
      With our main branches located in Makindye (Salaama Road) and Wakiso (Busabala), LUBASA Investments continues to be a reliable, multifaceted partner for schools, offices, and retailers across the region.
    </p>

    <!-- Mission & Vision Section -->
    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm border-t-4 border-t-brand-600">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-800 mb-4">Our Mission</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600">
          To empower businesses, institutions, and communities by providing reliable, high-quality supplies, equipment, and professional services, while driving local economic growth through job creation and efficient service delivery.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm border-t-4 border-t-brand-600">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-800 mb-4">Our Vision</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600">
          To be the most trusted and versatile partner for institutions and businesses across East Africa, recognized for our flexibility, integrity, and commitment to excellence in everything we do.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>